{"task":"transcribe","language":"English","duration":25.650999296,"text":" Your bank statement comes as a PDF. Every row is locked. Copy it into Excel and the columns fall apart. So people retype it line by line. Not anymore. Click the extension icon and the side panel slides out. Drop the statement in, hit convert, and two pages become one clean sheet with 53 rows. Dates, descriptions, debits, credits, running balance, all in the right columns. Download it as Excel or CSV and start working. Free, right in Chrome.","words":[{"word":"Your","start":0,"end":0.3},{"word":"bank","start":0.3,"end":0.6},{"word":"statement","start":0.6,"end":0.86},{"word":"comes","start":0.86,"end":1.18},{"word":"as","start":1.18,"end":1.4},{"word":"a","start":1.4,"end":1.56},{"word":"PDF.","start":1.56,"end":2.4},{"word":"Every","start":2.52,"end":2.7},{"word":"row","start":2.7,"end":2.86},{"word":"is","start":2.86,"end":3.04},{"word":"locked.","start":3.04,"end":3.78},{"word":"Copy","start":3.68,"end":3.78},{"word":"it","start":3.78,"end":3.92},{"word":"into","start":3.92,"end":4.12},{"word":"Excel","start":4.12,"end":4.36},{"word":"and","start":4.36,"end":4.56},{"word":"the","start":4.56,"end":4.68},{"word":"columns","start":4.68,"end":5.02},{"word":"fall","start":5.02,"end":5.28},{"word":"apart.","start":5.28,"end":6.08},{"word":"So","start":5.92,"end":6.08},{"word":"people","start":6.08,"end":6.3},{"word":"retype","start":6.3,"end":6.78},{"word":"it","start":6.78,"end":6.98},{"word":"line","start":6.98,"end":7.28},{"word":"by","start":7.28,"end":7.38},{"word":"line.","start":7.38,"end":8.22},{"word":"Not","start":8.08,"end":8.28},{"word":"anymore.","start":8.28,"end":9.02},{"word":"Click","start":9.08,"end":9.18},{"word":"the","start":9.18,"end":9.32},{"word":"extension","start":9.32,"end":9.74},{"word":"icon","start":9.74,"end":10},{"word":"and","start":10,"end":10.26},{"word":"the","start":10.26,"end":10.38},{"word":"side","start":10.38,"end":10.62},{"word":"panel","start":10.62,"end